1. Nurses
2. Health workers
3. Counseling workers (2) What is meant by providing recovery services carried out by social institutions as referred to in paragraph (1) letter a is as follows:a. volunteer assistants make efforts:
1. build equal relationships with victims so they are willing to open up in expressing their problems;
